<title>GERMANY: Varta 4-mo gp sales up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Varta 4-mo gp sales up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  760     up 26 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German battery manufacturer is Varta AG. The company also said it was able to improve earnings considerably and return to profit in the first four months. It said it had exceeded its earnings goals. The sharp increase in the price of lead last year prevented Varta from returning to profit in 1996, the company said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 757525</p>
</text>
